{"chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_009_v004","chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_chunkset_v004","chunk_index":9,"parent_chunk_id":null,"source_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930","section":"保護事件、通報與備註3、6","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"source_locator":"PDF實體頁1；保護事件、通報與備註3、6","text":"【流程圖正規化】照顧管理系統與家照據點均連到務必通報對象。疑似保護事件銜接家防中心；疑似脆弱家庭服務事件銜接社福中心；有自殺企圖者銜接自殺防治通報系統／社區心理衛生中心。備註3：保護事件係指家庭暴力、性侵害、兒少保護、老人保護及身心障礙者保護等保護事件。 備註6：長照人員及家照據點專員服務過程中發現有疑似保護事件、脆弱家庭服務事件或自殺企圖者，應透過關懷 e 起來（https://ecare.mohw.gov.tw/Help）線上通報。","embedding_text":"長照高負荷家庭照顧者轉介及服務流程｜保護事件、通報與備註3、6｜【流程圖正規化】照顧管理系統與家照據點均連到務必通報對象。疑似保護事件銜接家防中心；疑似脆弱家庭服務事件銜接社福中心；有自殺企圖者銜接自殺防治通報系統／社區心理衛生中心。備註3：保護事件係指家庭暴力、性侵害、兒少保護、老人保護及身心障礙者保護等保護事件。 備註6：長照人員及家照據點專員服務過程中發現有疑似保護事件、脆弱家庭服務事件或自殺企圖者，應透過關懷 e 起來（https://ecare.mohw.gov.tw/Help）線上通報。","metadata":{"source_file":"長照高負荷家庭照顧者轉介及服務流程_1140930四修.pdf","document_title":"長照高負荷家庭照顧者轉介及服務流程","source_type":"risk_rule","publish_agency":"mohw","authority_level":"official_government","primary_category":"transition_referral","persona_restriction":"professional_only","requires_human_review":true,"stop_normal_rag":false,"review_status":"needs_review","confidence_level":"high","current_status":"current","license_status":"open","official_source_url":"https://www.mohw.gov.tw/dl-78166-3cc0f176-f0d8-4f06-8046-b5809dd2823a.html","official_source_page_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6455-69938-207.html","license_source_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6476-70761-207.html","attribution_required":true,"source_version":"114年9月30日四修","source_version_date":"2025-09-30","revised_at":"2025-09-30","version_published_at":"2025-10-09","source_page_updated_at":"2025-10-28","published_at":null,"last_verified_at":"2026-07-29","version_check_status":"verified_official_source","language":"zh-TW","locale":"zh-TW","token_count":null,"parser_version":"pdfplumber_bbox_visual_review_v3","chunker_version":"flow_graph_semantic_chu